==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|mŭl'-tə-plĭ-kăndʹ}}, {{IPA|en|/ˌmʌltəplɪˈkænd/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ænd}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|arithmetic}} A number that is to be [[multiply|multiplied]] by another (the [[multiplier]]).
#: ''In the expression'' 5 × 3, ''the "3" is the '''multiplicand'''.''

